[en.IDEA_C04_TIMBUCKTU_BLESSING]
Timbucktu Blessing

[en.IDEA_C04_TIMBUCKTU_BLESSING_desc]
The jewelry made of Timbucktu crystal is popular in Stratusburg. Every customer who comes to visit Stratusburg will definitely bring a piece of Timbucktu jewelry, make a wish to the crystal and the starry sky, and pray for good luck to come.
In this jewelry craze, the autonomous government of Stratusburg cooperated with those mining speculators, making a lot of money...

[en.IDEA_C04_TIMBUCKTU_BLESSING_TOOLTIP]
Every month, we will obtain §Y50 Timbucktu Crystals§! from the sales of crystal jewelry as tax revenue.

[zh.IDEA_C04_TIMBUCKTU_BLESSING]
廷马克图的祝福

[zh.IDEA_C04_TIMBUCKTU_BLESSING_desc]
廷马克图水晶制成的首饰风靡小马利亚，每一位前来层云堡旅游的顾客都一定会带上一件廷马克图的首饰，向水晶与星空许愿，祈求好运的降临。
在这首饰热潮中，层云堡自治政府与那些采矿业投机商们合作，赚的盆满钵满...

[zh.IDEA_C04_TIMBUCKTU_BLESSING_TOOLTIP]
每个月，我们会从水晶首饰销售中获取 §Y50 廷马克图水晶§! 作为税收。
